{"id": "walton-bacr-trip-and-vote", "title": "A grantee paid a supervisor's trips; he voted it $4.78 million more", "seconds": 149.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "e77d92ba864182a1", "words": 404, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "Bay Area Community Resources runs job centers for the City, on a City grant.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.37, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Bay Area Community Resources", "sub": "runs job-services hubs for the City"}, "wt": [0.11, 0.21, 0.57, 0.99, 1.53, 1.88, 2.17, 2.48, 2.57, 2.72, 3.29, 3.37, 3.45, 3.72]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine", "suspicious[1]"], "text": "In October 2023, it paid for Supervisor Shamann Walton’s trip to Aspen.", "t0": 4.49, "t1": 9.83, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "A trip to Aspen", "sub": "Oct 9–11, 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.64, 0.91, 2.04, 2.19, 2.43, 2.58, 3.13, 3.6, 4.13, 4.51, 4.81]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine", "suspicious[1]"], "text": "Later, he voted to add money to its grant. How much?", "t0": 9.95, "t1": 13.61, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "A trip to Aspen", "sub": "Oct 9–11, 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.61, 0.75, 0.99, 1.09, 1.27, 1.5, 1.67, 1.83, 2.4, 2.97]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[2]"], "text": "4,780,000 dollars.", "t0": 13.61, "t1": 15.93, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$4,780,000", "label": "added to the grant, Sept 3, 2024"}, "emph": ["4,780,000"], "wt": [0.04, 0.41, 0.64, 1.0, 1.17, 1.71]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[1]", "story[3]"], "text": "He admitted that vote broke conflict of interest law. That’s proven.", "t0": 16.45, "t1": 19.99, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a serious violation of conflict-of-interest laws"}, "emph": ["proven"], "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.38, 0.61, 0.93, 1.28, 1.85, 1.99, 2.41, 2.83, 3.13]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[0]"], "text": "First, the gift: 1,679.30 dollars for Aspen.", "t0": 20.21, "t1": 25.71, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "The Aspen trip", "sub": "paid by BACR, reported on his Form 700", "chip": "$1,679.30"}, "emph": ["1,679.30"], "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.76, 1.79, 1.93, 2.37, 2.66, 2.94, 3.48, 3.94, 4.12, 4.36, 4.74, 4.97]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[0]"], "text": "He did report it.", "t0": 25.83, "t1": 26.79, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "The Aspen trip", "sub": "paid by BACR, reported on his Form 700", "chip": "$1,679.30"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.35, 0.7]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "story[2]"], "text": "So what’s wrong?", "t0": 26.91, "t1": 28.14, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "money", "name": "A gift over $590", "sub": "from BACR"}, {"art": "calendar", "name": "For 12 months", "sub": "the giver is his financial interest"}, {"art": "gavel", "name": "No vote", "sub": "on anything that affects it"}], "kicker": "The rule"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.54]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "story[2]"], "text": "A gift over 590 dollars ties him to the giver for 12 months.", "t0": 28.14, "t1": 32.39, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "money", "name": "A gift over $590", "sub": "from BACR"}, {"art": "calendar", "name": "For 12 months", "sub": "the giver is his financial interest"}, {"art": "gavel", "name": "No vote", "sub": "on anything that affects it"}], "kicker": "The rule"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.56, 0.81, 1.03, 1.27, 1.5, 1.9, 2.37, 2.66, 2.75, 2.86, 2.95, 3.22, 3.42, 3.76]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "story[2]"], "text": "He can’t vote on anything that affects it.", "t0": 32.51, "t1": 34.43, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "money", "name": "A gift over $590", "sub": "from BACR"}, {"art": "calendar", "name": "For 12 months", "sub": "the giver is his financial interest"}, {"art": "gavel", "name": "No vote", "sub": "on anything that affects it"}], "kicker": "The rule"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.32, 0.66, 0.83, 1.2, 1.3, 1.66]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]", "established[12]"], "text": "On September 3, 2024, the Board voted 11 to 0.", "t0": 34.55, "t1": 39.54, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2023-10-11", "to": "2024-09-03", "days": "328", "fromLab": "Aspen trip ends", "toLab": "his yes vote", "kicker": "The vote"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.53, 1.04, 1.3, 2.28, 2.39, 2.71, 3.01, 3.6, 3.93]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Walton voted yes, 11 months after Aspen.", "t0": 39.66, "t1": 42.96, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2023-10-11", "to": "2024-09-03", "days": "328", "fromLab": "Aspen trip ends", "toLab": "his yes vote", "kicker": "The vote"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.68, 1.47, 1.92, 2.34, 2.81]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The grant’s new limit: 14,779,999 dollars.", "t0": 43.08, "t1": 47.22, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$14,779,999", "label": "new ceiling, to June 30, 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.39, 0.59, 1.45, 1.72, 2.15, 2.55, 2.7, 3.41]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[1]", "story[3]"], "text": "His fine for the vote: 3,500 dollars.", "t0": 47.34, "t1": 50.9, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Fined July 10, 2026", "sub": "$3,500 for the vote, $4,500 in all"}, "emph": ["3,500"], "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.37, 0.46, 0.61, 1.04, 1.87, 2.36, 2.66, 2.95]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[1]", "story[3]"], "text": "4,500 in all, with an unrelated portrait gift.", "t0": 51.02, "t1": 54.85, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Fined July 10, 2026", "sub": "$3,500 for the vote, $4,500 in all"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.66, 0.86, 1.16, 1.36, 2.13, 2.34, 2.48, 3.07, 3.48]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[10]", "story[3]"], "text": "Of 420 gifts and paid trips that officials reported, Aspen is the largest", "t0": 54.97, "t1": 59.73, "shot": "b8a", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "420", "label": "gifts and paid trips reported by supervisors and mayors", "sub": "Aspen is the largest within a year of a vote on the giver's file"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.34, 0.62, 0.97, 1.34, 1.49, 1.76, 2.07, 2.21, 2.57, 3.72, 4.15, 4.27, 4.42]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[10]"], "text": "within a year of a Board vote on the giver’s own file.", "t0": 59.73, "t1": 62.69, "shot": "b8a", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "420", "label": "gifts and paid trips reported by supervisors and mayors", "sub": "Aspen is the largest within a year of a vote on the giver's file"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.25, 0.33, 0.57, 0.65, 0.73, 1.08, 1.46, 1.7, 1.8, 2.26, 2.51]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[3]"], "text": "Now the open questions, starting with a number.", "t0": 62.91, "t1": 65.48, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "First Amendment", "kicker": "Open question 1", "sub": "Oct 1, 2023"}, "wt": [0.09, 0.14, 0.3, 0.58, 1.52, 1.89, 1.98, 2.07]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[3]"], "text": "Just before Aspen, the City’s job office raised the grant. To what?", "t0": 65.6, "t1": 70.49, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "First Amendment", "kicker": "Open question 1", "sub": "Oct 1, 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.51, 1.31, 1.41, 1.76, 2.02, 2.41, 2.71, 2.83, 3.54, 4.11]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "9,999,999 dollars.", "t0": 70.49, "t1": 72.17, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$9,999,999", "label": "grant ceiling, Oct 1, 2023"}, "emph": ["9,999,999"], "wt": [0.04, 0.45, 0.65, 1.07]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "story[1]"], "text": "Why does that matter?", "t0": 72.69, "t1": 73.61, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "one dollar short"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.3, 0.46]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "story[1]"], "text": "Above 10 million, the City Charter sends a contract to the Board.", "t0": 73.61, "t1": 77.42, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "one dollar short"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.81, 1.02, 1.65, 1.75, 2.0, 2.34, 2.6, 2.68, 3.14, 3.25, 3.35]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "story[1]"], "text": "This stopped one dollar short. So no vote.", "t0": 77.54, "t1": 80.32, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "one dollar short"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.53, 0.73, 1.14, 1.71, 2.05, 2.31]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Nothing on file explains it. And that raise was the department’s, not Walton’s.", "t0": 80.44, "t1": 85.13, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The records don't say why."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.41, 0.73, 1.19, 1.54, 2.18, 2.4, 2.71, 2.84, 2.99, 3.93, 4.12]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[4]"], "text": "Next, an earlier trip.", "t0": 85.35, "t1": 86.92, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Honolulu", "kicker": "Open question 2", "sub": "Apr 26–29, 2023", "chip": "$1,618.12"}, "wt": [0.27, 0.59, 0.77, 1.14]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[4]", "established[11]"], "text": "In April 2023,", "t0": 87.04, "t1": 89.05, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Honolulu", "kicker": "Open question 2", "sub": "Apr 26–29, 2023", "chip": "$1,618.12"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.5, 0.77]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[4]", "established[11]"], "text": "it paid 1,618.12 dollars for him to go to Honolulu.", "t0": 89.05, "t1": 95.18, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Honolulu", "kicker": "Open question 2", "sub": "Apr 26–29, 2023", "chip": "$1,618.12"}, "emph": ["1,618.12"], "wt": [0.04, 0.18, 0.45, 0.66, 1.21, 1.5, 1.79, 2.35, 3.03, 3.36, 3.61, 4.16, 4.71, 4.91, 5.06, 5.24, 5.4]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "That’s 3,297.42 dollars", "t0": 95.3, "t1": 99.64, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$3,297.42", "label": "paid travel from one grantee in one year"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.43, 1.02, 1.4, 1.72, 2.5, 3.0, 3.34, 3.8]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "of travel in one year.", "t0": 99.64, "t1": 102.5, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$3,297.42", "label": "paid travel from one grantee in one year"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.25, 0.93, 1.52, 2.12]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "established[12]"], "text": "Honolulu came too early to count against the vote.", "t0": 102.62, "t1": 104.94, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$3,297.42", "label": "paid travel from one grantee in one year"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.5, 0.75, 0.9, 1.22, 1.35, 1.55, 1.81, 1.98]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[5]"], "text": "Then another round number. Now a raise needs a vote if it’s more than 500,000.", "t0": 105.16, "t1": 109.98, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["the line", "more than $500,000"], "b": ["the raise", "exactly $500,000"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.46, 0.73, 1.31, 2.08, 2.19, 2.44, 2.64, 2.76, 3.17, 3.39, 3.57, 3.7, 3.86, 4.1, 4.33]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[5]"], "text": "In January 2026, it grew how much?", "t0": 110.1, "t1": 113.84, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["the line", "more than $500,000"], "b": ["the raise", "exactly $500,000"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.67, 0.99, 2.2, 2.39, 2.92, 3.28]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[5]"], "text": "Exactly 500,000 dollars.", "t0": 113.84, "t1": 117.59, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$500,000", "label": "exactly, Jan 1, 2026", "sub": "to $15,279,999"}, "emph": ["Exactly"], "wt": [0.04, 1.3, 1.77, 2.55, 3.2]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[6]", "story[4]"], "text": "No vote needed. Later, 1.5 million more did need one.", "t0": 118.11, "t1": 123.83, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "June 9, 2026", "sub": "Walton excused"}, "emph": ["1.5 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.58, 1.75, 2.89, 3.11, 3.48, 3.71, 4.26, 4.69, 5.08, 5.31]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[6]", "story[4]"], "text": "Walton was excused.", "t0": 123.83, "t1": 125.98, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "June 9, 2026", "sub": "Walton excused"}, "wt": [0.04, 1.18, 1.39]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[8]", "established[7]"], "text": "The City has paid 16,434,698 dollars on this grant.", "t0": 126.2, "t1": 130.03, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$16,434,698", "label": "paid so far, of $16,779,999"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.28, 0.44, 0.68, 0.91, 1.38, 1.74, 1.92, 2.44, 2.94, 3.14, 3.32]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[8]", "established[7]"], "text": "And the state once fined Walton 600 dollars over 49ers tickets.", "t0": 130.15, "t1": 134.5, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$16,434,698", "label": "paid so far, of $16,779,999"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.16, 0.49, 0.77, 1.16, 1.57, 1.8, 2.12, 2.77, 3.17, 3.76]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "No finding that the trips bought his vote, or that he gained from it.", "t0": 134.62, "t1": 137.97, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That the trips bought the vote", "That Walton gained personally"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.62, 0.74, 0.85, 1.15, 1.37, 1.59, 2.24, 2.35, 2.48, 2.57, 2.9, 3.1]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle the rest?", "t0": 138.09, "t1": 139.41, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The job office’s memos on $9,999,999 and $500,000"}, {"who": "", "what": "Every Board roll call on BACR, April 2023 to October 2024"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.21, 0.47, 0.64]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "Memos on those two numbers, and every Board vote on this nonprofit.", "t0": 139.41, "t1": 143.16, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The job office’s memos on $9,999,999 and $500,000"}, {"who": "", "what": "Every Board roll call on BACR, April 2023 to October 2024"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.04, 0.56, 0.68, 0.88, 1.03, 1.63, 1.83, 2.1, 2.44, 2.69, 2.82, 3.04]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status"], "text": "The case is closed. He admitted it and paid.", "t0": 143.28, "t1": 145.93, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.3, 0.45, 1.04, 1.22, 1.62, 1.79, 2.14]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 146.05, "t1": 148.42, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.67, 0.81, 1.11, 1.17, 1.29, 1.61, 1.9]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "found": "Proven", "lead1": "Question 1 · one dollar short", "lead2": "Question 2 · Honolulu", "lead3": "Question 3 · exactly $500,000", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "number"}